                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's fine, teetering on kinda bad. I was thinking about giving it a positive until it continued to show off its mediocrity for 4 gruesome hours.\r\n\r\nIt gives lots of \"first game\" vibes, with pretty bad voice acting, whack cinematography, default graphics and clunky gameplay. The world is pretty cool, I guess? And it for sure has some great ideas and designs in a vaccuum, but the writing does them no justice. By the end I had fully turned off my brain and was just waiting for it to end.\r\n\r\nI don't really regret playing it all too much? But if it comes down to spending real human money, just don't.",
